        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Latch Hole Filler Plate for 161 Cut Out</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis filler plate is 2-1/4\" high by 1-1/8\" wide and covers a standard 161 door prep. (standard commercial door) door latch hole. Packaged with 2 installation screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese are normally used when a <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\">Panic Device</a> is installed on a pre-drilled hollow metal commercial door to cover the door latch hole.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo EF-161 Latch Filler Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
